ria Mehjabin and Jabid, Taskeed and Ali, Md Sawkat},\n  journal={Data in Brief},\n  volume={47},\n  pages={108941},\n  year={2023},\n  publisher={Elsevier}\n}\n\n```\n\nAli, Sawkat; Ibrahim, Muhammad ; Ahmed, Sarder Iftekhar ; Nadim, Md. ; Mizanur, Mizanur Rahman; Shejunti, Maria Mehjabin ; Jabid, Taskeed (2022), “MangoLeafBD Dataset”, Mendeley Data, V1, doi: 10.17632/hxsnvwty3r.1\nCopy to bucket new\nUse this dataset \n\nDownloads last month\n    46\nNumber of rows: 4,000 Total file size: 141 MB\nSystem theme\nCompany\nTOS⟨150⟩ Privacy⟨151⟩ About⟨152⟩ Careers⟨153⟩ ⟨1⟩\nWebsite\nModels⟨2⟩ Datasets⟨3⟩ Spaces⟨4⟩ Pricing⟨8⟩ Docs⟨6⟩\n",
